# Implementation

This folder contains the PostgreSQL database schema and MVC-structured application logic for the **Smart Shopping App**.

## Structure
- `database/schema.sql` — PostgreSQL tables, constraints, and indexes.
- `src/models/cart_engine.py` — Core business logic for subtotal calculation, promotional discounts, 90%/100% budget alerts, 50g weight validation, and SHA-256 QR receipt signing.
